      "Calculates overall quality scores, compliance percentages, content counts, and completeness estimates.",
      "Creates a markdown verification report for reviewers and stakeholders.",
      "Creates quality metrics data for CI pipelines and dashboards.",
      "Provides pass, review, or fail recommendations based on validation results.",
      "Documents generation process details, issue summaries, and next steps."
    ],
